le`.\n- The hardship sympathy sentence and the debt introduction are my wording, not the spec's.\n- \"Missing clock time: ask, never guess\" for callbacks.\n- \"If [a date] precedes the earliest eligible date, offer the earliest eligible date.\"\n- \"Never offer a discount, waiver or a new payment plan,\" and \"a correction invalidates consent\" (which requires a fresh combined read-back).\n\nFiles are in `out/`:\n- ext-policy-reason-every-close.policy.json\n- ext-policy-reason-every-close.audit.json"}
{"event": "policy_compiled", "run_id": "7fb7604196594ca5a8588bd9722e1434", "pid": 141048, "time": "2026-10-11T00:47:47-0700", "elapsed_s": 174.501, "artifact": "out/ext-policy-reason-every-close.policy.json", "bands": 4, "identity_fields": ["registered_birth_date", "access_code", "district"], "special_cases": ["already_paid", "dispute", "hardship", "restructuring", "human", "scam", "refuse_to_talk"], "unresolved": [{"topic": "close reasons for AGREED and SETTLED", "text": "A reason is REQUIRED on EVERY close, including AGREED/SAVED and SETTLED/PAYMENT-REPORTED. The IR has no dedicated reason field for promise_outcome/paid_outcome; the reasons are carried only in outcomes.table (AGREED -> SAVED, SETTLED -> PAYMENT-REPORTED).", "doc": "sources/000-01-specification.md"}, {"topic": "hardship sympathy wording", "text": "Illness, bereavement or unemployment: one short sympathetic sentence \u2014 the exact words are not dictated; the hardship `say` is a written sentence matching that content.", "doc": "sources/000-01-specification.md"}, {"topic": "debt introduction wording", "text": "State every product, amount and days late before asking for anything. No introductory sentence is dictated; phrases.debt_intro is a written sentence matching that content.", "doc": "sources/000-01-specification.md"}, {"topic": "callback missing clock time", "text": "Missing clock time: ask, never guess. The IR has no dedicated field; behaviour must be enforced by the dialogue.", "doc": "sources/000-01-specification.md"}, {"topic": "date before earliest eligible date", "text": "If it precedes the earliest eligible date, offer the earliest eligible date, provided it is within deadline. The IR has no dedicated flag for this rule.", "doc": "sources/000-01-specification.md"}, {"topic": "no discounts or plans; consent invalidated by corrections", "text": "Never offer a discount, waiver or a new payment plan. A correction invalidates consent and requires revalidation and a fresh combined read-back. No dedicated IR fields; enforced by the template.", "doc": "sources/000-01-specification.md"}], "audit_fixed": ["phrases.debt_intro was empty although \u00a71 requires stating every product, amount and days late before asking for anything; wrote a short sentence with that content and reworded the related unresolved entry.", "api_fields: \u00a71 explicitly names the get_account fields (products list, product_id, type, past_due, days_late) and \u00a78 names ok=true for create_promise; recorded them alongside verify_identity.remaining.", "Expanded source spans (hint retry, multi-product, phrases, promise_write) to cite the sentences that support the values.", "Added unresolved entries for rules with no IR field: callback missing clock time, date before earliest eligible date, no discounts/plans and correction invalidating consent."], "audit_unresolved": ["No IR field for the close reasons of AGREED (SAVED) and SETTLED (PAYMENT-REPORTED); carried only in outcomes.table.", "Hardship sympathetic sentence and debt introduction wording are not dictated; written sentences are used.", "Callback 'Missing clock time: ask, never guess' has no IR field.", "'If it precedes the earliest eligible date, offer the earliest eligible date' has no IR flag.", "'Never offer a discount, waiver or a new payment plan' and 'A correction invalidates consent' have no IR fields."], "defaulted_without_source": [], "unknown_special_cases": [], "api_mapping_notes": []}
